---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Line from '../components/Line.astro';
import MainText from '../components/MainText.astro'
import CommentDew from '../components/CommentDew.astro';
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle = "About">
    <MainText>
      <div class="all">
        <div class="head">
          <div class="head-card hello-card">
            <span class="hello-text">你好，我是<ruby><rb>Yirween</rb><rt>/ ˈ ɪ ( r ) . w i ː n /</rt></ruby></span>
          </div>
          <div class="head-card headimg-card">
            <img src="/ynhdimgRD.png" alt="这里是Yirween的头像，但是它不见了">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="head-card profile-card">
          <span class="mobile-warning">本站还没有适配移动端，所以在手机上可能会有一些显示问题，建议在电脑上访问喵~</span><br />

          在这里，你可以了解到一些关于我的信息，或者说是一些我想让你知道的东西。<br />
          目前还没有什么内容，不过以后会慢慢补充的喵~<br />
          你也可以通过下面的联系方式找到我！<br />
          <ul>
            <li>邮箱：<a class="linka" href="mailto:yirween@outlook.com" target="_blank">yirween@outlook.com</a></li>
            <li>bilibili：<a class="linka" href="https://space.bilibili.com/648129231" target="_blank">@繄溦-yirween-</a></li>
            <li>QQ：<a class="linka" href="https://qm.qq.com/q/cfe8KVvngc" target="_blank">2155384970</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <style>
        .all {
          width: 100%;
        }
        .linka {
          color: #0e181acb;
          text-underline-offset: none;
          text-decoration: none;
          position: relative;
          display: inline-block;
          background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="128" height="128" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="m13.29 9.29l-4 4a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l4-4a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M12.28 17.4L11 18.67a4.2 4.2 0 0 1-5.58.4a4 4 0 0 1-.27-5.93l1.42-1.43a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.42a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0l-1.27 1.28a6.15 6.15 0 0 0-.67 8.07a6.06 6.06 0 0 0 9.07.6l1.42-1.42a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m7.38-14.18a6.18 6.18 0 0 0-8.13.68L10.45 5a1.09 1.09 0 0 0-.17 1.61a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0L13 5.3a4.17 4.17 0 0 1 5.57-.4a4 4 0 0 1 .27 5.95l-1.42 1.43a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l1.42-1.42a6.06 6.06 0 0 0-.6-9.06"/></svg>'); 
          background-repeat: no-repeat;
          background-position: top right;
          background-size: 16px 16px;
          padding-right: 20px;
          z-index: auto;
        }

        /* 个人简介部分 */
        .profile-card {
          width: calc(100% - 64px);
          height: auto;
          margin-top: 3vh;
          padding: 32px;
        }

        /* 顶部信息部分 */
        .head {
          width: 100%;
          display: flex;
          flex-wrap: nowrap;
          justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .hello-card {
          width: calc(100% - 15vh - 5%);
          height: 15vh;
          padding: 16px;
          margin-right: 5%;
          font-size: calc((100vw - 53px)*0.36 / 10);
          font-family: "黑体";
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
        }

        .headimg-card {
          width: 15vh;
          height: 15vh;
          padding: 16px;
          display: flex;

          img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
          }
        }

        .head-card {
          border-radius: 8px;
          background-color: #ffffff;
          box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00000010;

          rt {
            font-size: calc((100vw - 53px - 40vw)*0.6 / 35);
          }

          .hello-text {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #a1c4fd 0%, #c2e9fb 100%);

            /* 标准语法：将背景裁剪到文字区域（目前仅 WebKit 浏览器支持较好） */
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            /* 将文字颜色设为透明，露出背景 */
            color: transparent;
          
          }
        }

        .mobile-warning {
          display: none;
          color: #ff0000;
          font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
          .mobile-warning {
            display: block;
          }
        }
      </style>
